      statement: "auto-pr must converge to a merged state or an explicit failure within one invocation, regardless of concurrent activity on dev (tracker syncs, other merges, CI re-triggers). Silent failures (HTTP 200 + not merged) and misleading status (failure when CI passed) are violations."  # 1094
      root_cause: "auto-pr assumed sequential execution but operates in concurrent environment with tracker sync, CI re-triggers, and other merges advancing dev."  # 1094
      fix: "Added retry cascade for HTTP 200+merged:false, rebase-on-405, plumbing-based tracker sync to avoid branch interference, and misleading status fix."  # 1094
